    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16406" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσπλαγχν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without bowels,</i> or
			rather, <i>without heart</i>: metaph., <i>dastard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				472
			</span></i>; <i>unsympathetic, merciless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
